{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "关于机关革命化的指示（一九六七年十月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n361)\n关于机关革命化的指示\n（一九六七年十月）\n不要调人。二十多个人就够了。要那么多人干什么呢？人少了，多下去，会也开的短一些，在下面解决问题，少搞些小报。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-983be32bb1c429035be9", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-361.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "ffd25b69f8a0c9b4528ab649c97b5483315bfded1f803bacda5be841d84b7300", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "aa5b590debe405ab8ab19840b0904544f47e869f8acd92caa5b49eb5de09047a", "text_chars": 149}
